 README.md                           | 12 ++++++----
 packaging/clangd-index-nav/PKGBUILD | 11 ++++-----
 scripts/build-clangd.sh             | 35 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 56 insertions(+), 10 deletions(-)
